{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Dressing the Part", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Proper Suit", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Proper Interview Attire", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "First impressions are important in the workplace. When you go for a job interview, it is important that you are well prepared and that you look your best.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In North America, the way you dress at a job interview can be a deciding factor in whether you are successful or not.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are some tips about the proper interview attire:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "1. Dress one or two levels \u201cup\u201d. In other words, dress slightly higher than what is the standard attire for the job you are applying for.  <br>2. Your clothes should be clean and well-cared for. Avoid wearing colors that are too faded and old looking. Avoid wearing colors that are too bright or distracting. Make sure there are no stains or rips.  <br>3. Wear appropriate shoes - and make sure they are clean. <br>4. Have your hair styled neatly. <br>5. Avoid wearing strong smelling perfumes - most workplaces are scent-free. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you look the part, it will help you get the part!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense</span> to talk about something that will be in progress at a particular time in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> to talk about future events which are:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "1. expected <br><br> For example:  <br><span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ll be thinking</span> about it all next week.</span>  (You anticipate or expect that you will be thinking about it all next week).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "2. decided<br><br>For example: <br><span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ll be going</span> shopping all next week as well.</span>  (Based on what happened, you decided you will be going shopping next week).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br>Look at the chart for the structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will + be + v-ing\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be going</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shopping next week.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be getting </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ready for her interview. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "iron", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a heavy instrument with one flat side used to remove wrinkles from clothes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This shirt has a lot of wrinkles, but I don't have an iron.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and interview attire.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "blazer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a suit jacket worn with no matching pants", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The blue shirt is a good idea, but I don't think you should wear a blazer. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to make a good impression", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give a sense of what kind of a person you are based only on appearance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Remember, you have already made an impression based on how you're dressed before you say a single word to the interviewer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "matching", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes something that goes well with something else because it has a complementary color or style", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should wear a matching jacket and pants, a dress shirt, a tie, coordinating socks and dress shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dress code", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way people are expected to dress", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: For the interview, you should dress more formally than the company dress code.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find an old magazine. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look through it and choose a few outfits that you think would be appropriate for a job interview.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Cut out the outfits and prepare a small poster to display the outfits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your poster with your classmates and explain why you think those outfits are appropriate. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I find examples of appropriate work outfits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I display them and explain my opinion about each.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions about my classmates' posters.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can make and respond to a request.   ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss future plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about events and experiences related to jobs. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do people wear to a job interview in your country? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you believe in first impressions? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "You should avoid loud colors and flashy ties!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "questions": []}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Kristi and Adam talk about Adam's interview and the proper attire.  What <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">coordinating</span> items should he wear?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"co