selected": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le13ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Are you ready for your interview, Adam?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Not really. I'll be worrying about it all next week.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Have you decided what you will  be wearing?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>:  I was thinking about wearing a solid blue shirt and grey jacket. Could you give me your opinion?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>:  Of course. The blue shirt is a good idea, but I don't think you should wear a blazer. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: I thought I would dress a bit more casually this time.<br>"}, {"time": "21000", "image": "engenn9le13ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: That's not a good idea. Remember, you have already made an impression based on how you're dressed before you say a single word to the interviewer. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Everyone at their office is dressed casually.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: For the interview, you should dress more formally than the company dress code.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Would you mind helping me choose something else?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Sure. You need to dress in an appropriate way for the position you are applying for. Usually, this means wearing a suit. You should wear a matching jacket and pants, dress shirt, tie and dress shoes. A dark suit with a light shirt is a good option.<br>"}, {"time": "56000", "image": "engenn9le13ob02re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Ok. I think I'll need to buy some new clothes. Could you give me some suggestions?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: It would be my pleasure.  You should avoid loud colors and flashy ties. Also, your clothing should be neat, clean, and well pressed.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: I don't have an iron.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Oh, Adam. Maybe that was your problem at the last interview. I can lend you one, but you should get one of your own. Consider it an investment in your future.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Ok, I guess I'll be going shopping all next week as well!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi</span>: It will have been worth buying a few things if you get the job.<br>"}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "id": 0}]}